```
Reason:
The patch eliminates the fatal error handling and server halt, allowing the system to continue functioning even when an invalid `SystemToken` is encountered. This change ensures that authentication failures are treated the same as regular user failures, enhancing the system's resilience against denial-of-service attacks.

